# Context Commander migrations — read by systemd for ccd-migrate.service,
# which runs before every start of ccd.service. Root-only on purpose: this
# is the schema OWNER's password, which the server itself never gets
# (docs/adr/0002).
#
# Leave CC_DATABASE_URL commented out to run migrations by hand instead;
# the unit is then skipped.
#CC_DATABASE_URL=postgres://cc_owner:CHANGE_ME@127.0.0.1:5432/context_commander?sslmode=disable
